e wall, silencing him, and leaves the body entombed for over fifty years, ending with a hollow 'In pace requiescat.'\"\n    28→    }\n    29→  ],\n    30→  \"characters\": [\n    31→    {\n    32→      \"id\": \"char_fortunato_b564181f\",\n    33→      \"canonical_name\": \"Fortunato\",\n    34→      \"aliases\": [],\n    35→      \"role\": null,\n    36→      \"appearance\": null,\n    37→      \"personality\": null,\n    38→      \"voice_guidance\": null,\n    39→      \"descriptions\": [\n    40→        {\n    41→          \"text\": \"Fortunato is a man whose pride in his expertise in wine leads to his downfall, as he is manipulated by Montresor under the guise of a shared appreciation for rare Amontillado. Though initially portrayed as confident and carefree, his demeanor shifts from amusement to terror as he realizes he is being murdered, revealing a tragic arc from arrogance to desperate pleas for mercy.\",\n    42→          \"source_position\": 88,\n    43→          \"chapter_index\": null,\n    44→          \"confidence\": \"llm_refined\"\n    45→        }\n    46→      ],\n    47→      \"relationships\": {},\n    48→      \"evidence\": [],\n    49→      \"voice_notes\": null,\n    50→      \"first_appearance_chapter\": 1,\n    51→      \"mention_count\": 14,\n    52→      \"confidence\": \"low\",\n    53→      \"is_narrator\": false,\n    54→      \"narrative_role\": null\n    55→    },\n    56→    {\n    57→      \"id\": \"char_montresor_dcb3c455\",\n    58→      \"canonical_name\": \"Montresor\",\n    59→      \"aliases\": [],\n    60→      \"role\": null,\n    61→      \"appearance\": null,\n    62→      \"personality\": null,\n    63→      \"voice_guidance\": null,\n    64→      \"descriptions\": [],\n    65→      \"relationships\": {},\n    66→      \"evidence\": [],\n    67→      \"voice_notes\": null,\n    68→      \"first_appearance_chapter\": 1,\n    69→      \"mention_count\": 1,\n    70→      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n    71→      \"is_narrator\